# Projects Engine — Cursor rules (v1.4.4)

English-only UI labels, notices, placeholders, and code comments/JSDoc.
Obsidian plugin id: `projects-engine`. Mobile-compatible (`isDesktopOnly: false`).
No Node builtins in the browser bundle. Persist content only via `vault.process`.

## 1. Codebase map

| Path | Responsibility |
| --- | --- |
| `src/main.ts` | Plugin entry: settings load/migrate, view registration, commands, ribbon, `refreshOpenViews`, reminder tick |
| `src/models/types.ts` | Domain types (`Project`, `Task`, `ItsmItem`, `ProjectsEngineSettings`, helpers) |
| `src/settings.ts` | Settings tab (folders, archive, Default PM, templates, sync, statuses, Eisenhower, scheduling honesty, performance) |
| `src/engine/Indexer.ts` | Debounced entity index from vault frontmatter |
| `src/engine/Scheduler.ts` | DAG schedule + `CommandStack` undo/redo (manual Auto-schedule; `cascade` helper for tests / future UI) |
| `src/engine/debounce.ts` | Trailing-edge debounce for indexer / UI |
| `src/views/projectRows.ts` | `ProjectRow` load + legacy migration (active / archived splits) |
| `src/services/projectFlags.ts` | Non PM / Technical intervention / ITSM parse + budget labels |
| `src/services/projectIo.ts` | `patchProjectFrontmatter` via `vault.process` |
| `src/services/projectArchive.ts` | Archive / unarchive folder moves + path-based `archived` reconcile |
| `src/services/metadataSync.ts` | Sync & Rebuild Note Metadata |
| `src/services/taskIo.ts` | Task parse/load/save (`loadAllTasks`, `saveTaskNote`) |
| `src/services/taskReminders.ts` | Scheduled reminder Notices (single-pass vault scan) |
| `src/services/taskNotesControls.ts` | In-place task notes preview controls |
